Dynamic Programming
-------------

difference b/w greedy method and dynamic programming:
-------------------------------

both are used to solve optimization problem
optimization problem is those which requires minimum result or maximum result

in greedy method we follow pre defined procesure to get the optimal result. eg: spanning tree problem, dijkstra algorithm etc

but in dyamic programming we tries to find out all possible solution and then pick up the best optimal solution.

mostly dp problem solve by recusion formula (not recusion programming)

------------------

two way we can solve a problem using dp:

1. memoization method - top down approach (using recursion)
2. tabulation method - bottom down approach (using iteration)



